    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni akombeka ekikaarekye yakimalira emyaka 13.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayombeka Enju y'Ekibira kya Lebanoni. Oburai bwayo bukaba buli bw'emita 44, n'obukika bw'emita makumi 22, obwemi mita 13 1/2. Agyombeka aha mita 3 z'enyomyo z'emielezi, n'eiguru z'enyomyo ezo yarambikaho eboriti z'emielezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashakara n'embaho z'emielezi ebiyumba ebyabaire byombekesiibwe enyomyo 45, buli rujuru rwinayo 15. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba eina emizilingiti y'amadilisha omu njuru ishatu buli rubaju, mara galebangaine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emizilingiti y'enyigi zona n'ey'amadilisha ekaba eina oburai n'obukika obulikwigana. Amadirisha ga buli rubaju gakaba galebangaine n'agandi omu njuru zonshatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayombeka Enju y'Enyomyo, oburai bwayo bukaba buli mita 22, n'obukika mita 13 1/2. Omu maisho g'enyomyo akataho ekishasi n'orutimbe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayombeka Enju y'Enketo, omwo nimwo yaramuliraga, nilyo iramuliro. Ekaba eyombekesiibwe emielezi kwema aha sakafu kugoba aha miraipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyarujuye ey'okuturamu eyabaire eli enyuma y'eiramuliro, emyombekere yayo yashushanaga amaju agandi. Kandi yayombekera mukaziwe, muhara wa Farao enju elikushusha nyaruju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaju aga gona gakaba gombekesize amabare g'eiguzi, agabaizirwe kuhonderana n'ebipimo, gashazirwe n'emishumeno enyuma n'omu maisho, kwema aha kitebe kuhika eiguru, kandi kwema nyakabuga ka Rwensinga y'Omukama kugoba nyarubuga empango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe kikaba kili ky'amabare g'eiguzi, gahango, amabare gakaba gaina emita ishatu n'enusu, agandi mita 4. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiguru yago hakaba haliho amabare g'eiguzi, agabaizire kuhonderana n'ebipimo, haliho n'emielezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyarubuga ekaba eina enjuru ishatu z'amabare agabaizire embaju zona, n'orujuru rumoi rw'eboliti z'emielezi. Ekishasi kya nyakabuga ka Rwensinga y'Omukama nakyo kikaba kyombekire kityo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomoni atumaho Hiramu owa Tiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba ali mwana w'entumbwakazi ow'oruganda rwa Nafutali. Ishe ogwo akaba ali wa Tiro. Hiramu yabaga muhesi w'omulinga. Akaba aina obumanyi bungi, amagezi n'obubuya aha kuhesha buli kantu ak'omulinga. Aija ow'Omukama Solomoni amukolera emilimoye yona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni ahesha enyomyo ibili z'omulinga. Buli emoi ekaba eina obwemi bw'emita 18, okugifunganisa ni nk'emita 5 1/2, n'omugoma gw'engingo inai. Zikaba zili murangara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahesha ebituuti bibili by'omulinga abitungika aha nyomyo. Obwemi bwa buli kituti bukaba nibushagamu emita 2. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha bituuti ebyo aha iguru y'enyomyo yahesheraho ebisiika bibili, yabitaho n'enkinga ibili z'emikofu. Ekisiika aha nyomyo emoi n'ekisika aha nyomyo endijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahesha n'amakomamanga enkubo ibili, agazingoza ekisiika kushweka ekituuti ekyabaire kili aha nyomyo eiguru. Akolera atyo n'ekituuti ekindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebituuti ebyabaire bili eiguru y'enyomyo omu kishasi bikaba bitonirweho orwakyo rw'amalebe emita nka2. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebituuti bikaba bili aha nyomyo zombili n'aha irokezo elyabaire lyataine ekisiika. Amakomamanga gakaba gali 200 buli nyomyo omu njuru ibili obuzingora, n'enyomyo endijo etyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomyo azemeleza aha kishasi kya Rwensinga. Enyomyo eyo yayemeleize kasi yagyeta Yakini, ayemeleza endijo bikara agyeta Boazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha nyomyo eiguru hakaba haliho orwakyo rwa lilia. Omulimo gw'enyomyo nikwo gwahoire gutyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu akahesha etanki y'amaizi ey'omugoma gw'emita 13 n'omushobyo obuzingora, obwemi mita 2 n'omushobyo, n'emita nka 4 1/2 obuchwekanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahansi y'omugoma gwayo hakaba haliho enjuru ibili z'obushusi obuhesherainwe n'etanki egyo bugizingoire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba eshuntamire aha numi 12, 3 zilebire bikara, 3 zilebire obugwaizoba, na 3 zilebire kasi n'eishatu zilebire oburugaizoba. Enumi ezo, ez'etangi yabaire etungikirweho zikaba ziterangaine enkinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuhango bwayo bukaba nibwigana oburai bw'ekiganja. Omugoma gukaba guli nk'ogw'ekikompe anga nk'orwakyo rwa lilia. Yagibwagamu amaizi elita 20,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu akahesha amagurudumu 10 g'omulinga. Buli limoi likaba lina oburai bw'emita nka 2, obukika bw'emita nka 2, n'obwemi bw'emita nka 1 1/2. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gakaba gakozirwe gati: Gaina ebibati biturukiraine, nabyo bikomirwe aha ufremu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bihesherainwe n'entare, n'enumi n'abakerubi. Aha furemu eiguru n'ahansi, n'aha bishushane by'entare n'enumi hakaba haliho enkinga ezikozirwege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi buli gurudumu likaba lina entaro inai z'omulinga, n'emishumare y'omulinga y'okuzingolerwaho entaro ezo. Buli pembe okwo zili inai hakaba haliho eky'okukwata ebeseni. Eby'okukwata ebyo bikaba bihesherainweho enkinga buli rubaju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obutahiro bw'egali egyo bwaturukiraga ahatungamire ah'oburai bw'enusu mita tuti. Bukaba bukozirwe obuzingora nk'ekibunu, bwina obuhango nk'enusu mita. Omu bukinguliro bwayo hakaba habaizire, n'ebibati byakyo bikaba bili by'omuraba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagurudumu eina zikaba zili ahansi y'ebibati. Emishumare y'okuzingolerwaho amagurudumu ekaba ehesherainwe nago. Obwemi bw'egurudumu bukaba buli nk'enusu mita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagurudumu gakaba nigashusha ag'amagali: Amalenge gazo g'okuzingolerwaho amagurudumuago, hamoi na gonene, n'enyoma zamwo bikaba bili biheshano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba haliho eby'okubangira ebeseni inai aha pembe inai za buli gurudumu, n'ebibangiso bihesherainwe n'egurudumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha gurudumu eiguru hakaba haliho orutaro rw'obwemi bw'enusu mukono. Ensiso n'ekibati bikaba bihesherainwe n'egurudumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiguru y'ensiso n'ekibati yatonaho abakerubi, n'entare, n'emikindo, kuhonderana n'omwanya gwa buli kimoi. Abizingoza enkinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo yakozire atyo amagurudumu gona 10. Gona gakaheshwa kumoi, nigaigana mara nigashushana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu ahesha n'ebeseni 10 z'omulinga; buli emoi yagyagwamu elita nka 800, na buli beseni ekaba eina obuchwekanisa bw'emita nka 2. Amagurudumu 10 buli limoi akalitaho ebeseni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagurudumu gatanu agata rubaju orwa kasi ya Rwensinga n'agatanu rubaju orwa bikara. Etangi agita oburugaqizoba, bwolekera bwa kasi ya Rwensinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu ashuba ahesha enyungu, n'ebitihyo, n'ebeseni. Aho amalira Omukama Solomoni omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomyo ibili, enyabya ibili z'enyakyo ezabaire zili eiguru yazo, n'ebisiika by'okushwekesa enyabya z'ebituuti by'enyomyo ezabaire zili eiguru y'enyomyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'amakomamanga 400 gateirwe aha bisiika bibili, buli kisiika enjuru ibili z'amakomamanga kushwekesa ebituuti ebikozirwe nk'enyabya aha nyomyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akora amagurudumu 10 n'ebeseni 10; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "etanki y'amaizi emoi n'enumi 12 ezabaire zitungikirweho etanki egyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyungu, n'ebitihyo, n'ebeseni, ebikwato ebi byona bikaba bili bya Rwensinga y'Omukama. Nibyo yahesheire Omukama Solomoni. Bikaba bihesirwe omu mulinga enchenkure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomoni akabiheshera omu muteleka gwa Yordani omu rubumba, omugati ya Sukoti na Zaretani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni tiyapimire busikizi bwa bikwato byona, kuba bikaba bili bingi. Obusikizi bw'omulinga nabwo tibabupimire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni akora atyo ebikwato byona ebyabaire bili Rwensinga y'Omukama: Ealutare y'ezahabu, emeza y'ezahabu eyatekwagaho emikate y'obusinge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ensindi z'etara z'ezahabu enchenkure, itanu rubaju orwa kasi n'eitanu rubaju orwa bikara omu maisho g'Omwanya Ogutakatifu nyakabara. Akora enyakyo, etara, eby'okukwasa amakara eby'ezahabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebikompe n'emikasi y'okushaza, ebeseni, ebyotezo by'obunuuma, eby'okutahuza omuliro eby'ezahabu enchenkure; n'epata z'ezahabu z'enyigi z'Ahatakatifu nyakabara n'ez'enyigi za Rwensinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo Omukama Solomoni yamazire elyombeka lyona lya Rwensinga y'Omukama. Atahyamu ebintu ebyo Daudi ishe yabaire ahongire: Efeza n'ezahabu n'ebikwato, abibiika omu sitoa za Rwensinga y'Omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
